# The mobile app reads its configuration from app.json -> expo.extra (not from this file):
#   extra.apiUrl          API base URL (Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:4000, device: your LAN IP or the public URL)
#   extra.eas.projectId   EAS project id (needed for push tokens and store builds) - from `eas init`
# Per-environment values belong in app.config / EAS build profiles (eas.json), never in git with secrets.
